   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Vika turns a corner in the corridor and runs straight into Max, the man she met in the nightclub. Max plays it cool and says the head chef is begging him to join the kitchen, which makes her furious. Here is the argument in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
